; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Tibetan / བོད་སྐད་ (bo)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

སྤོ counter 5

launch_loop:
མ་ལག_འབོད་པ counter
འཐེན counter 1
བསྡུར counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
སྤོ box 999
མ་ལག_འབོད་པ box
